{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07813","headline":"陪独孤使君同与萧员外证登万山亭 · 孟浩然","name":"陪独孤使君同与萧员外证登万山亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万山青嶂曲，千骑使君游。\n神女鸣环佩，仙郎接献酬。\n遍观云梦野，自爱江城楼。\n何必东南守，空传沈隐侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07813.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07813","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}